Quoting  Doug Freyburger <dfreybur@yahoo.com>:
>Use level 1 spells to do it because they cost fewer
>power points and have higher success rates.

They don't cost fewer power points per amount of training; a successful
level n cast is worth n points of training. Hence any spell with a 0%
success rate is equally useful for training purposes, and often this will
not restrict you to level 1 spells. In particular a class's special spell
may be superior to a level 1 spell in some circumstances.
